  "_comment": "What a note, comment or run result may mount in the app: every tag (`html`, `svg`) and every attribute (`attributes` per tag, `*` for all tags, `svgAttributes` for every svg tag), as hast property names (strokeWidth, className, ariaLabel). ONE list, read by the frontend sanitizer (src/lib/markdownSchema.ts, which keeps rehype-sanitize's value constraints on top) and by the MCP's render check (crates/cxtasks-core/src/prose.rs), so what an agent is warned about and what the pane drops cannot drift. It lives in this crate because the NAS images copy crates/ and not src/. `attributes` must stay a superset of rehype-sanitize's defaultSchema names; markdown.test.tsx fails if an upgrade adds one.",
